SUMMARY:Dream Retirement: Social Security Strategy Evening in Tomball
DESCRIPTION:Be Retirement Prepared presents the free\, educational Dream Retirement: Social Security Strategy Evening at Hyatt Place Houston NW Vintage Park in Tomball. \nThe evening will cover Social Security’s current rules\, the recent SECURE 2.0 changes\, and the filing and timing strategies that could help you make the most of the benefits you have earned. \nSocial Security is one of the biggest financial decisions of retirement\, and one of the few you usually cannot undo. \nHighlights\n\nCurrent Social Security rules and recent SECURE 2.0 changes\nTradeoffs of claiming early versus later\, and how to weigh the timing\nHow spousal and survivor benefits work for married couples\nFiling strategies that could help you make the most of your benefits\n\nThere will be no pressure and nothing is sold\, just clear guidance and a chance to get your questions answered. Seating is limited\, so reservations are recommended. \nDoors open at 6:45pm. \nAdmission\nFree with RSVP. RSVP or learn more. \n  \n  \n  \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/dream-retirement-social-security-strategy-evening-in-tomball/
LOCATION:Hyatt Place Houston NW Vintage Park\, 20330 Tomball Pkwy\, Houston\, 77070\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Classes + Workshops,Continuing Education,Featured,Finance & Investing,Free,Home & Living,Learning & Personal Development,Offers,Pop-Ups,Talks & Panel Discussion
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Dream-Retirement-Social-Security-Strategy-Evening-in-Tomball.jpg
END:VEVENT
