SUMMARY:Ella Mai in Concert at Smart Financial Centre
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Ella Mai—multi-platinum\, Grammy-winning R&B singer-songwriter—to the Sugar Land stage. \nShe first broke through in 2018 with her chart-dominating single Boo’d Up\, which held the top spot for the most weeks of any song by a woman on the R&B/Hip-Hop Billboard Airplay chart. \nHer success has earned her a Grammy Award for Best R&B Song along with  multiple Billboard Music Awards\, iHeartRadio Awards\, Soul Train Awards\, an NAACP Image Award\, and a BET Viewers’ Choice Award. \nAma and Girlfriend join the show. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $54. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/ella-mai-in-concert-at-smart-financial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Sugar Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
