SUMMARY:The Murder Mystery Co's Dinner Theater Show at Saltgrass Steak House
DESCRIPTION:The Murder Mystery Co. presents a hilarious\, interactive murder mystery dinner event\, where you just might be the killer\, at Saltgrass Steak House in the Washington Corridor\, just south of the Heights. \nMingle with intriguing suspects\, uncover shocking secrets\, and savor a tasty 3-course meal. But anyone\, including you\, may end up as the cold-blooded killer. \nThere’s a new mystery with a new theme every month. \nFor August\, the whodunit is set at an 1950s sock hop. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $69.45. Order tickets or learn more. \nCall the box office at 888-659-2952 to avoid fees and save $9. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-murder-mystery-cos-dinner-theater-show-at-saltgrass-steak-house-august-2026/
LOCATION:Saltgrass Steak House\, 1803 Shepherd Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 77007\, United States
