SUMMARY:DroneArt Show: Harry Potter at Constellation Field
DESCRIPTION:DroneArt Show returns to Houston with an official Harry Potter light show in the sky at Constellation Field in Sugar Land. The show promises to be an unforgettable open-air spectacle as 1\,200 illuminated drones recreate favorite characters and beloved moments from the Harry Potter films. \nAs night falls\, hundreds of synchronized illuminated drones take off and create shapes in the sky\, moving in time with John Williams’ movie score played live in a 65-minute performance. \n\nInspired by the Wizarding World\, the show ensures every guest takes part in the experience with exclusive LED wristbands. \n\n\n\nThe open air setting will have food and drink for sale. Plus—whether you’re sorted into houses Gryffindor\, Hufflepuff\, Ravenclaw or Slytherin—costumes and Wizarding World attire are highly encouraged. \n\nAdmission\nTickets start at $48; $28 for ages 3 to 11. Order tickets or learn more.   This Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. Learn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/droneart-show-harry-potter-at-constellation-field-2/
LOCATION:Constellation Field\, 1 Stadium Dr\, Sugar Land\, TX\, 77498\, United States
